{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>יליץ</b> — he will speak, whose testimony is justice and righteousness, from the root מ–ל–ץ; or he will speak mockery about justice." "<b>יבלע</b> — as in: כבלע את הקדש (like swallowing the sacred offering)."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "Resolved the definition as deriving from the root מ–ל–ץ based on the two senses Ibn Ezra offers; the first aligns with the meaning 'to speak pleadingly/eloquently,' the second with 'to mock.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:45.127020768Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}